VENDORED FONTS — SIL OPEN FONT LICENSE 1.1
================================================================================

This skin redistributes four font binaries under assets/fonts/. They are
latin-subset builds of open-source typefaces and are NOT covered by the MIT
license above. Each is licensed under the SIL Open Font License, Version 1.1,
which permits redistribution and bundling:

  Newsreader      (normal, italic)  — Copyright 2020 The Newsreader Project Authors
  Inter           (normal)          — Copyright 2016 The Inter Project Authors
  JetBrains Mono  (normal)          — Copyright 2020 The JetBrains Mono Project Authors

Full license text: https://openfontlicense.org

