This is an unofficial fan tribute. "Claude" and "Anthropic" are trademarks of
Anthropic PBC. This theme reproduces the visual language of the claude.ai
interface; it is not affiliated with or endorsed by Anthropic.

The typefaces Anthropic uses in that interface (Copernicus and StyreneB) are
commercially licensed and are NOT included here. This theme substitutes the
open Newsreader and Inter in their respective roles.
